OL,3,GNEWSAYouth Olympics call-up a 'dream
OL,4,Abirthday present'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe day before her 17th birthday, Jaya
OL,7,FKalsi received a phone call with the
OL,8,Fkind of news that every young boxer
OL,9,Fdreams of.
OL,11,FThe athlete, from Warwick, had been
OL,12,Fselected to represent Team GB at the
OL,13,F2026 Youth Olympic Games in Dakar,
OL,14,FSenegal, in what she described as an
OL,15,F"amazing present to get".
OL,17,FWith the Games getting under way on 31
OL,18,FOctober, Kalsi is preparing to fly out
OL,19,Ffor what will be the highest-level
OL,20,Fcompetition of her career so far.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
