OL,3,GNEWSAYouth Olympics call-up a 'dream
OL,4,Abirthday present'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I'm looking forward to it, it's a
OL,7,Fgreat honour to represent Team GB and
OL,8,Fmy country," she said.
